- action(n1, "start"): Hallucinates an initial step; the source explicitly states "the first step is to gather information about the part from the customer".
- action(n5, "end procedure"): Hallucinates a termination action; the source states "the process comes to an end" immediately after retrieving, requiring a direct precedence link to end(e1).
